iling"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Scheduling"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Deadlines"},{"type":"p","text":"│ └── Case Closure"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Legal Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Legal Research"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Legal Writing"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Contract Law"},{"type":"p","text":"│ └── Procedural Law"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Case Files"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Document Indexing"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Procedural Records"},{"type":"p","text":"│ └── Correspondence"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Case Management Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── E-Hearings"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── LegalTech"},{"type":"p","text":"│ └── AI Tools"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Professional Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Communication"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Coordination"},{"type":"p","text":"│ ├── Project Management"},{"type":"p","text":"│ └── Confidentiality"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"└── Advanced Areas"},{"type":"p","text":"├── International Arbitration"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Commercial Arbitration"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Construction Disputes"},{"type":"p","text":"└── Online Dispute Resolution"}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest positioning for this career is:"},{"type":"p","text":"“ADR professional combining legal knowledge, arbitration/mediation procedure, case management, legal technology and project coordination.”"},{"type":"p","text":"For this particular career, excellent organisation and procedural discipline are just as important as legal knowledge. A student who can manage complex case files, track dozens of deadlines, coordinate lawyers and tribunals, maintain confidentiality, and use modern legal-technology tools will have a strong foundation for progressing from ADR Case Manager → Senior Case Manager → ADR Institution/Dispute Resolution Manager."}]}]}